        "text": "**Defining the LLM Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the LLM provider for the `extract_json.py` script. The next step is to make sure it's identifiable in the code. I am thinking of how best to ensure the code references the chosen provider.\n\n\n**Identifying the LLM Provider**\n\nNow I have a clearer roadmap. I'll create the `extract_json.py` file and start importing the required Vertex AI libraries. Then, I will create a function that handles the text input and calls the LLM, making sure to include necessary calls, such as `vertexai.init` and model name, so that the code identifies Google's Vertex AI as the LLM provider.\n\n\n",
